<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakhstan auctions 600 mln tenge bills July 30.</title>
<headline>Kazakhstan auctions 600 mln tenge bills July 30.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan will auction 600 million tenge of 12-month MKM discount Treasury bills on July 30, the National Bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Full details of the 12-month issue:</p>
<p>    Series number		  KZ4CK3007986</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   600 million tenge</p>
<p>    Denominations		  100 tenge</p>
<p>    Tenor			    364 days</p>
<p>    Issue date		     July 30, 1997</p>
<p>    Maturity date		  July 30, 1998</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
